+/**
+ *******************************************************************************
+ *
+ * @brief
+ *  This function performs quantization, followed by Inverse
+ *  quantization to find transform domain SSD
+ *
+ * @par Description:
+ *  Performs quantization on coeffs
+ *
+ * @param[in] pi2_coeffs
+ *  4x4 Coeffs
+ *
