+/**
+ *******************************************************************************
+ *
+ * @brief
+ *  This function performs residue calculation and forward  transform on
+ * input pixels
+ *
+ * @par Description:
+ *  Performs residue calculation by subtracting source and  prediction and
+ * followed by forward transform
+ *
+ * @param[in] pu1_src
