+/**
+********************************************************************************
+*  @fn     compute_mv_cost_refine(search_node_t *ps_node,
+*                   pred_ctxt_t *ps_pred_ctxt,
+*                   PART_ID_T e_part_id)
+*
+*  @brief  MV cost for coarse explicit search in coarsest layer
