+********************************************************************************
+*  @fn   void hme_refine_frm_init(me_ctxt_t *ps_ctxt,
+*                       refine_layer_prms_t *ps_refine_prms)
+*
+*  @brief  Frame init of refinemnet layers in ME
+*
+*  @param[in,out]  ps_ctxt: ME Handle
+*
+*  @param[in]  ps_refine_prms : refinement layer prms
+*
+*  @return None
