+/*****************************************************************************/
+/*                                                                           */
+/*  function name : mac32x16in32_shl_sat                                     */
+/*                                                                           */
+/*  description   : multiply WORD32 with WORD16 add bits 46 to 15 to acc     */
+/*                  takes care of saturation in multiply and addition        */
