+/*!
+******************************************************************************
+* \file ihevce_coarse_me_pass.c
+*
+* \brief
+*    Converts the language of the encoder to language of me. This is an i/f
+*    between the encoder style APIs and ME style APIs. This is basically
+*    a memoryless glue layer.
+*
+* \date
+*    22/10/2012
+*
