+    enc_group_pong -> MAX_NUM_VERT_UNITS_FRM for all the passes (NUM_ENC_JOBS_QUES)------------>|_______|
+    pre_enc_group_ping -> MAX_NUM_VERT_UNITS_FRM for all the passes (NUM_PRE_ENC_JOBS_QUES)---->|_______|
+    pre_enc_group_ping -> MAX_NUM_VERT_UNITS_FRM for all the passes (NUM_PRE_ENC_JOBS_QUES)---->|_______|
